OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fmostly die out through the evening
OL,7,Fwith just the odd light one lingering
OL,8,Fover Shetland through the night, and a
OL,9,Ffew clear spells developing. Winds
OL,10,Fwill become mainly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA mainly dry day with some
OL,13,Fbright spells, but the cloud may
OL,14,Fthicken enough to bring the odd spot
OL,15,Fof rain. Lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
