OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fmixed period with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells. Some showery
OL,8,Fbursts of rain at times too, briefly
OL,9,Fheavy. Quite breezy on Wednesday, then
OL,10,Fturning warmer.
